        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Lena learned chess at twenty six and lost most of her first hundred games to one careless move. When a club coach taught her the three checks, her results changed within a month.</p><p>She has coached adult club players for eight years and run an evening class for five. Tempo is that class, filmed. This is sample text; replace it with your own story.</p>"
