        },
        "heading_2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Most videos show brilliant moves, not your mistakes"
          }
        },
        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Grandmaster games are fun to watch and teach very little at club level. People in Lena's class kept losing the same way: a loose piece, a missed check, a fork two moves deep. The course fixes those first.</p>"
          }
        }
